**
** Stringers and frames: linear general beam sections (sheet 4.2) in the
** homogeneous quasi-isotropic material E = 55.85 GPa, nu = 0.326 (sheet 3.3).
** The third node of each B31 element lies on the fuselage axis, so n1
** points inward along the radius. n2 is tangent to the skin.
** I11 is about n1 (lateral bending), I22 is about n2 (radial bending).
** The centroid is offset inward along n1. The shear centre is put at the
** centroid [assumption]; the sheet gives no value.
*BEAM GENERAL SECTION, ELSET=STRINGERS, SECTION=GENERAL
